# The plugin's own module resolution directory. On a development machine this is
# a junction into the harness profile's hoisted `node_modules`, which makes bare
# peer imports resolve from a `link:`-installed copy. It is machine-local and
# must never be committed; a normal `file:` or git install does not need it.
node_modules/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# `npm pack` output.
*.tgz

# A locally linked harness profile if one is ever created here.
.pnpm-store/
